uest Info Give How can we help? Search Popular Searches Programs Admissions Apply Directory Academic Calendar Employment Opportunities Tuition & Costs Financial Aid About Why Marywood? Mission & Values Marywood History Leadership Fast Facts Pacer Profiles Location Sustainability Ratings & Rankings Student Consumer Information Human Resources Academics Colleges & Departments Programs of Study Academic Calendar Registrar's Office Academic Success Academic Affairs Centers of Excellence Tutoring Services Core Curriculum Library Summer Sessions Accreditations & Approvals Admissions Admissions Office Undergraduate Transfer Students Graduate & Doctoral International Veterans Admitted Students Pre-Collegiate Intensive English Program Find Your Counselor Pay My Deposit Life@MU Campus Life Involvement Student Events Dining Student Experience Faith & Service Global Education Title IX Bookstore Orientation Student-Run Media Affordability Financial Aid Apply for Aid Types of Aid Tuition Policies Financial Forms Pay My Bill Alumni Alumni Association Pacer Perks Awards & Recognitions Alumni Events Alumni Pacer Profiles Make a Gift Alumni Resources Alumni Class Notes Giving Day Community News & Events Book Your Event Academic & Athletic Camps Youth Programs Galleries Health & Wellness Clinics Veterans Center Marian Chapel Nativity Miguel African Sisters Education Collaborative Marywood Heights Retirement Community Athletics Why Division III? Prospective Athlete Forms Athletics Schedule Athletic Awards Watch Now Facilities & Rental Info Aquatic Center Support the Pacers Visiting Team & Fan Guide Hall of Fame Athletics Staff Directory Info For Students Parents Alumni Faculty Staff Quick Links Brightspace MarywoodYou Email Forms Academic Calendar Directory Pay My Deposit Admissions Pay My Deposit Pay My Deposit Admissions Office Liberal Arts Center | 120 8:30 a.m. - 4:30 p.m. 570-348-6234 YourFuture@marywood.edu Ready to become a Pacer? The first thing you need to do is to accept our offer of admission by submitting your deposit, so we can hold a place for you in our next class! Be sure to use your applicant credentials to sign in. After you pay your deposit, you'll gain access to a checklist of required new student forms in your applicant portal. These include the emergency contact form, housing form (if applicable), new student event registration forms, and others. Check your applicant portal often for new student info! Pay My Deposit Contact Information Marywood University View on Map 2300 Adams Avenue, Scranton, PA 18509 570-348-6211 Privacy Policy Web Accessibility Title IX Accreditations Mission Campus Policies Campus Safety Contact Careers Academic Catalog Library Tech Help Bookstore Virtual Tour MIDDLE STATES Resources for the Marywood Community Students Families Alumni Faculty Staff Follow Marywood: Instagram TikTok X (formerly Twitter) Facebook YouTube Linkedin Sponsored by The Congregation of the Sisters, Servants of the Immaculate Heart of Mary Notice of Non-Discrimination Policy Marywood prohibits discrimination on the basis of actual or perceived race, color, sex (including ex-based harassment, gender, sex stereotypes, sex characteristics, pregnancy or related conditions, sexual orientation, and/or gender identity), national origin (including shared ancestry and ethnic characteristics), age, creed, religion, disability, marital status, citizenship, genetic information, military/veteran status, political belief or affiliation, use of a guide or support animal, and any other class of individuals protected from discrimination under federal, state, or local law, regulation, or ordinance in any of the University’s educational programs and activities, and in the employment (including application for employment) and admissions (including application for admission) contexts. Concerns or reports can be shared with Nick Moore, Assistant Director of Career Services/Title IX & Title VI Coordinator. Marywood University, Scranton, PA 18509-1598.